[Name] SDDM
[Summary] QML-based X11 and Wayland display manager
[License] GPL-2.0-or-later
[Description] Modern display manager using QML for its greeter. Build with systemd support disabled for Gobo; configured later to auto-login into the Awesome (X11) or Sway (Wayland) session.
[Homepage] https://github.com/sddm/sddm
